The pipeline should also take an optional next function that can be called to continue the pipeline.
If the next function is not called, the pipeline should end.
If the next function is called, the pipeline should continue with the next middleware function.
If the next function is called multiple times, the pipeline should only continue with the next middleware function once.
If the next function is called before the current middleware function has finished executing, the pipeline should wait for the current middleware function to finish before continuing.

